{"seq":8,"slug":"social-network-analysis","title":"社会网络分析","stage":"DONE","category":"sociology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis","rating":{"composite":4.22,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"社会网络分析\">社会网络分析</h1><p>社会网络分析（Social Network Analysis, SNA）以&quot;关系&quot;而非&quot;属性&quot;为分析单元来理解社会：它不把个体看作孤立的原子，而是追问&quot;谁与谁相连、处于关系网的什么位置、结构又如何塑造信息、资源与权力的流动&quot;。从找工作、组织协作，到谣言扩散、流行病传播，SNA 提供了一副洞察社会&quot;隐藏结构&quot;的透镜。它兼具社会学的理论深度（嵌入性、社会资本、弱连带）与图论、线性代数的精确工具，是互联时代日益重要的高度跨学科领域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 的定位（与兄弟 hub 的分工）</h2><p>本系列从<strong>社会学</strong>视角讲 SNA——侧重理论意涵（关系视角、社会资本、弱连带、结构洞）、经典实证研究（米尔格拉姆、格兰诺维特、伯特）与社会后果（不平等、扩散、伦理）。它与若干&quot;近亲&quot; hub 边界清晰、互为补充：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>侧重</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的分工</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/fundamentals/graph-definitions-representations\">数学·图论</a></td>\n<td>图的数学定义、算法、定理</td>\n<td>提供本 hub 的数学地基（邻接矩阵、最短路径）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../data-science/network-graph-analysis/foundations/graph-basics\">数据科学·网络与图分析</a></td>\n<td>工程实现、大规模计算</td>\n<td>把本 hub 的度量变成可跑的代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/small-world\">系统思维·网络科学</a></td>\n<td>物理/复杂系统视角</td>\n<td>网络模型的一般化（小世界、无标度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/foundations/graph-representation\">AI·图神经网络</a></td>\n<td>图上的机器学习</td>\n<td>本 hub 概念（PageRank）的现代延伸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../social-interaction/group-collective-behavior/social-networks-analysis\">社会互动·群体与集体行为</a></td>\n<td>微观互动</td>\n<td>从面对面互动切入，本 hub 从结构切入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>一句话分工</strong>：图论给方法、数据科学给工具、网络科学给模型、本 hub 给社会学意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p><strong>前置</strong>：无需社会学或数学专业背景；若想深究公式，建议先浏览<a href=\"../../mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/fundamentals/graph-definitions-representations\">图论·图的定义与表示</a>的邻接矩阵部分。建议顺序阅读，每章为下一章铺垫：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[1 基础: 关系视角/节点连边/图与矩阵] --&gt; B[2 基本度量: 度/距离/密度]&#10;  B --&gt; C[3 中心性: 度/中介接近/特征向量]&#10;  C --&gt; D[4 中观结构: 社群/弱连带/结构洞]&#10;  D --&gt; E[5 动态与意义: 扩散/演化/应用/伦理]\">graph LR\n  A[1 基础: 关系视角/节点连边/图与矩阵] --&gt; B[2 基本度量: 度/距离/密度]\n  B --&gt; C[3 中心性: 度/中介接近/特征向量]\n  C --&gt; D[4 中观结构: 社群/弱连带/结构洞]\n  D --&gt; E[5 动态与意义: 扩散/演化/应用/伦理]</pre><ul>\n<li>第一章<a href=\"foundations/relational-perspective\">社会网络分析基础</a>：确立关系视角与嵌入性，介绍节点、连边、图与矩阵两种表示。</li>\n<li>第二章<a href=\"basic-concepts/degree\">网络的基本概念与度量</a>：度（及友谊悖论）、距离（及小世界）、密度与连通性（及巨大成分）。</li>\n<li>第三章<a href=\"centrality/degree-centrality\">中心性与网络位置</a>：弗里曼三中心性 + 特征向量/PageRank/邦纳西奇权力，揭示位置如何转化为权力。</li>\n<li>第四章<a href=\"structure-and-community/communities\">网络结构与社群</a>：社群发现、弱连带与桥、结构洞——SNA 对社会学最深刻的贡献。</li>\n<li>第五章<a href=\"dynamics-and-significance/diffusion\">网络动态与意义</a>：扩散、演化、应用，以及隐私与权力的伦理反思。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读完你将获得一副洞察社会隐藏结构的透镜，也将对&quot;关系如何塑造社会&quot;这一根本问题多一分理解，并能批判性地看待其在防疫、平台、情报中的应用与风险。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"社会网络分析基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"relational-perspective","title":"关系视角","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/foundations/relational-perspective"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nodes-and-ties","title":"节点、连边与网络构成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/foundations/nodes-and-ties"},{"seq":3,"slug":"representation","title":"图与矩阵的表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/foundations/representation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"basic-concepts","title":"网络的基本概念与度量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/basic-concepts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"degree","title":"节点的度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/basic-concepts/degree"},{"seq":2,"slug":"distance-and-paths","title":"距离与路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/basic-concepts/distance-and-paths"},{"seq":3,"slug":"density-and-connectivity","title":"密度与连通性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/basic-concepts/density-and-connectivity"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"centrality","title":"中心性与网络位置","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/centrality","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"degree-centrality","title":"度中心性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/centrality/degree-centrality"},{"seq":2,"slug":"betweenness-closeness","title":"中介中心性与接近中心性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/centrality/betweenness-closeness"},{"seq":3,"slug":"eigenvector-and-power","title":"特征向量中心性与权力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/centrality/eigenvector-and-power"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"structure-and-community","title":"网络结构与社群","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/structure-and-community","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"communities","title":"凝聚子群与社群","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/structure-and-community/communities"},{"seq":2,"slug":"weak-ties-and-bridges","title":"弱连带与桥","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/structure-and-community/weak-ties-and-bridges"},{"seq":3,"slug":"structural-holes","title":"结构洞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/structure-and-community/structural-holes"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"dynamics-and-significance","title":"网络动态与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/dynamics-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"diffusion","title":"网络上的扩散","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/dynamics-and-significance/diffusion"},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-evolution","title":"网络的演化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/dynamics-and-significance/network-evolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications","title":"应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/dynamics-and-significance/applications"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"意义、伦理与未来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/dynamics-and-significance/significance"}]}]}